  note = {The Visa Chart Components utils library includes functions for accessible interactivity. `setElementFocusHandler` adds focus listeners to highlight elements when navigating via keyboard; `setElementInteractionAccessState` toggles interactive elements to semantic buttons; and `setElementAccessID` assigns unique IDs to tie elements to ARIA properties. These utilities help developers create chart components that meet keyboard and screen reader requirements:contentReference[oaicite:24]\{index=24\}.}
}

